// bastion (B-AG2, row 40): the archetype decision table — ONE shared
// brain reads these instead of hardcoded per-profession branches
// (rtsim/src/rule/npc_ai/archetype.rs). Weight = the chance the brain's
// consideration pass takes the activity when its preconditions hold
// (the exact semantics of the old inline `random_bool` constants, moved
// verbatim: herbalist/hunter 0.8, guard 0.7). An activity absent from an
// archetype's map is NOT ALLOWED for it; an archetype absent here gets
// no data-driven activities at all (graceful default).
//
// Converted this block: herbalist / hunter / guard. The §4 expansion
// pass (agency-bible.md) sweeps farmer / merchant / chef and adds
// species-class keys for wild bodies — extend HERE, not with new code
// branches.
(
    archetypes: {
        "herbalist": (
            activities: {
                "gather_forest": 0.8,
            },
        ),
        "hunter": (
            activities: {
                "hunt_forest": 0.8,
            },
        ),
        "guard": (
            activities: {
                "patrol_plaza": 0.7,
            },
        ),
    },
)
